  "decision_summary": "The query is epothilone D, a desoxy analog of patupilone. The high-similarity patupilone record provides direct in vivo evidence of CNS penetration and overrides the physicochemical prior of low passive BBB plausibility. Therefore, meaningful CNS access is predicted.",
